CORE
main.c
--signed-overflow-check
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main.overflow.1\] line 10 arithmetic overflow on signed + in i + 1: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
in s [+-] 1
in c [+-] 1
^warning: ignoring
--
++ and -- on short and signed char work on the operand promoted to int, so
they cannot overflow; ++ on int can.
